# 9. ARITHMETIC OPERATORS

Arithmetic operators are used for mathematical calculations.

| Operator | Name           | Example   |
| -------- | -------------- | --------- |
| `+`      | Addition       | `10 + 5`  |
| `-`      | Subtraction    | `10 - 5`  |
| `*`      | Multiplication | `10 * 5`  |
| `/`      | Division       | `10 / 5`  |
| `%`      | Modulus        | `10 % 3`  |
| `**`     | Exponentiation | `2 ** 3`  |
| `//`     | Floor Division | `10 // 3` |

---

